<%# Same sections, same order as report.html.erb (Dr::ReportModel::SECTIONS); help as bullets -%>
# <%= m.passed ? '🟢' : '🔴' %> <%= m.headline %>

**<%= m.passed ? 'Passed' : 'Failed' %>** · <%= m.subline %>

| <%= m.tiles.map { |v, _| md(v) }.join(' | ') %> |
|<%= m.tiles.map { ':-:' }.join('|') %>|
| <%= m.tiles.map { |_, l| md(l) }.join(' | ') %> |

## <%= sections[0] %>

<% m.plain_words.each do |line| -%>
- <%= line %>
<% end -%>

## <%= sections[1] %>

<% if m.attention.empty? -%>
Nothing needs attention.
<% else -%>
<%= attention_count %>

| | Check | Seen on | What it means | What to do |
|:-:|---|---|---|---|
<% m.attention.each do |a| -%>
| <%= emoji(a[:status]) %> | <%= md(a[:name]) %> | <%= md(a[:hosts]) %> | <%= md(a[:means]) %> | <%= md(a[:todo]) %> |
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

## <%= sections[2] %>

| | # | Step | Start (UTC) | Took |
|:-:|:-:|---|---|---|
<% m.steps.each do |s| -%>
| <%= emoji(s[:ok] ? :ok : :fail) %> | <%= s[:n] %> | <%= md(s[:name]) %> | <%= s[:start] %> | **<%= s[:took] %>** |
<% end -%>

**What each step does**

<% m.steps.each do |s| -%>
<% next unless s[:does] -%>
- **<%= s[:n] %> · <%= s[:name] %>**: <%= s[:does] %><% if s[:if_fails] %> *If it fails:* <%= s[:if_fails] %><% end %>
<% end -%>

## <%= sections[3] %>

<% if !m.verified -%>
Not reached: the run stopped before verification, so no checks ran.
<% else -%>
Each check exercises the real thing, not a status file.

<% m.groups.each do |g| -%>
### <%= g[:name] %>

| Check | <%= m.hosts.map { |host| md(host) }.join(' | ') %> |
|---|<%= m.hosts.map { '---' }.join('|') %>|
<% g[:rows].each do |r| -%>
| <%= md(r[:name]) %> | <%= m.hosts.map { |host| (c = r[:cells][host]) ? "#{emoji(c[0])} #{md(c[1].to_s.empty? ? status_word(c[0]) : c[1])}" : '—' }.join(' | ') %> |
<% end -%>

<% g[:rows].select { |r| r[:proves] }.each do |r| -%>
- **<%= r[:name] %>**: <%= r[:proves] %>
<% end -%>

<% end -%>
<% end -%>
## <%= sections[4] %>

- **Included:** <%= m.scope[:included].join(' · ') %>
- **Not included:** <%= m.scope[:excluded].join(' · ') %>

So the time customers would actually wait is the rebuild time plus those three.

## <%= sections[5] %>

| Claim | Evidence | How to check |
|---|---|---|
<% m.evidence.each do |claim, ev, how| -%>
| <%= md(claim) %> | <%= md(ev) %> | <%= md(how) %> |
<% end -%>

## <%= sections[6] %>

| | |
|---|---|
<% m.glossary.each do |word, meaning| -%>
| <%= md(word) %> | <%= md(meaning) %> |
<% end -%>

---
<sub>Generated <%= m.generated %> by <code><%= m.drill ? 'rake aws:dr_drill' : 'rake aws:setup_infra' %></code></sub>
